abstract: >-
  Zero-dependency Node.js CLI and library that builds a column-level lineage graph from SQL files,
  rehearses schema changes with proof paths, separates confirmed from possible impact, and writes
  sealed Markdown, HTML and JSON reports. Offline and read-only.
